    "detailed_description": "*The game is a fangame for the Korean vocaloid &quot;Uni,&quot; and the character and story shown in the game are not related to the official setting <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096560/extras/3e1a7b4db6d90a5d2fbc9497332a82bd.avif?t=1730282131\" width=600 height=123 /></span><br><br>The little girl, Uni, who is the main character in The Little UNI, left the planet she was living in after a fight with the 'Rose' and left to find a new planet where she could live.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096560/extras/24dfadbf2ab60d8e991637af30aa7bd4.avif?t=1730282131\" width=600 height=123 /></span><br><br> It won\u2019t be easy to leave the planet you have lived throughout your life to find a new planet, but the experience of listening to stories of people living on planets with their own personalities and spending time with them will certainly be wonderful. <br><br><br>Listen to the various characters' stories with various hand-drawn illustrations. Between the various planets, people, and stories, please watch what will be Uni\u2019s final decision.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096560/extras/06d9009ce8fce6bfb51446a4c35a81ac.avif?t=1730282131\" width=600 height=123 /></span><br><br>Will Uni return to the planet where \u2018Rose\u2019 is, or will she find a new planet to settle in?",
    "about_the_game": "*The game is a fangame for the Korean vocaloid &quot;Uni,&quot; and the character and story shown in the game are not related to the official setting <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096560/extras/3e1a7b4db6d90a5d2fbc9497332a82bd.avif?t=1730282131\" width=600 height=123 /></span><br><br>The little girl, Uni, who is the main character in The Little UNI, left the planet she was living in after a fight with the 'Rose' and left to find a new planet where she could live.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096560/extras/24dfadbf2ab60d8e991637af30aa7bd4.avif?t=1730282131\" width=600 height=123 /></span><br><br> It won\u2019t be easy to leave the planet you have lived throughout your life to find a new planet, but the experience of listening to stories of people living on planets with their own personalities and spending time with them will certainly be wonderful. <br><br><br>Listen to the various characters' stories with various hand-drawn illustrations. Between the various planets, people, and stories, please watch what will be Uni\u2019s final decision.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096560/extras/06d9009ce8fce6bfb51446a4c35a81ac.avif?t=1730282131\" width=600 height=123 /></span><br><br>Will Uni return to the planet where \u2018Rose\u2019 is, or will she find a new planet to settle in?",
